      "source": "<code>driver</code> - a driver instance",
      "translation": "<code>driver</code> - 驱动程序实例",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This will create a transaction manager for the default database.",
      "translation": "这将创建默认数据库的事务管理器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This will create a transaction manager targeting whatever the database selection\nprovider determines.",
      "translation": "这将创建一个事务管理器，其目标由数据库选择提供者确定。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Start building a new transaction manager for the given driver instance.",
      "translation": "为给定的驱动程序实例开始构建新的事务管理器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>databaseSelectionProvider</code> - the database selection provider to determine the\ndatabase in which the transactions should happen",
      "translation": "<code>databaseSelectionProvider</code> - 用于确定事务应发生在哪一数据库的数据库选择提供者",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2019–2026 <a href=\"https://neo4j.com\">Neo4j, Neo4j Sweden AB</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2019–2026 <a href=\"https://neo4j.com\">Neo4j、Neo4j Sweden AB</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This method provides a native Neo4j transaction to be used from within a\n<a href=\"../Neo4jClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.neo4j.core\"><code>Neo4jClient</code></a>. In most cases this the\nnative transaction will be controlled from the Neo4j specific\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>. However, SDN\nprovides support for other transaction managers as well. This method registers a\nsession synchronization in such cases on the foreign transaction manager.",
      "translation": "该方法提供了一个原生的 Neo4j 事务，可在 <a href=\"../Neo4jClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.neo4j.core\"><code>Neo4jClient</code></a> 内部使用。在大多数情况下，该原生事务将由 Neo4j 特定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> 进行控制。然而，SDN 也支持其他事务管理器。在这些情况下，该方法会在外部事务管理器上注册会话同步机制。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Dedicated <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> for native\nNeo4j transactions. This transaction manager will synchronize a pair of a native Neo4j\nsession/transaction with the transaction.",
      "translation": "专为原生 Neo4j 事务配置的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>。该事务管理器将原生 Neo4j 会话/事务与事务进行同步。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A builder for <a href=\"Neo4jTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.neo4j.core.transaction\"><code>Neo4jTransactionManager</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于构建<a href=\"Neo4jTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.neo4j.core.transaction\"><code>Neo4jTransactionManager</code></a>的类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
